{"availability":"available","full":"Nyvora-Vision-Labs/FaceToREADME","name":"FaceToREADME","description":"FaceToREADME is a web app that transforms your face photo into personalized ASCII art for your GitHub README. Upload a selfie, customize the character style and level of detail, and preview your portrait in real time. Copy the result as Markdown or download it as an SVG to give your profile a creative, personal touch.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-09T22:19:36Z","updated":"2026-10-09T22:54:26Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://nyvora-vision-labs.github.io/FaceToREADME/","topics":[],"demo":"https://nyvora-vision-labs.github.io/FaceToREADME/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T11:19:32.709Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T11:19:32.709Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T11:19:32.709Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T23:10:57.602Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T11:19:32.709Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live site: nyvora-vision-labs.github.io/FaceToREADME","Turn a face photo into ASCII art for your GitHub README — entirely in the browser. Photos are decoded and converted with the Canvas API and never uploaded anywhere."],"features":["Drag-and-drop or file-picker upload (JPG, PNG, WebP up to 15 MB) with validation for unsupported, empty, corrupt, or oversized files","Pan / zoom / pinch cropper with aspect presets, keyboard support, and a mini-map of the original","Width, brightness, contrast, detail (sharpening), character density, auto levels, and invert controls with live preview","Palettes: Fine (default, 15 tonal steps), Classic, Detailed, Blocks, Minimal, Retro, and Custom","Animated README portrait: download an SVG that draws itself line by line (SMIL, plays on GitHub — no JavaScript), choose speed and loop, and copy a ready-to-paste README snippet"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nyvora-Vision-Labs/FaceToR